        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Slow Blink"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(enchantment, incapacitation, mental, occult, visual)\n\nThe angoyang lets out a small meow and slowly blinks twice at a single creature.\n\nThe target must attempt a DC 31 Will save. On a critical success, the target is unaffected and immune to Slow Blink for 24 hours. Otherwise, the creature is overcome with the urge to pet the angoyang's silken fur, becoming fascinated. If the angoyang attacks the creature, the creature can attempt a new save at the beginning of their next turn."
            },
